{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26992","headline":"奉和前司封苏郎中喜严常侍萧给事见访惊斑鬓之什 · 姚合","name":"奉和前司封苏郎中喜严常侍萧给事见访惊斑鬓之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遶鬓沧浪有几茎，珥貂相问夕郎惊。\n祗应爲酒微微变，不是因年渐渐生。\n东观诗成号良史，中台官罢揖高名。\n即提彩笔裁天诏，谁得吟诗自在行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}